{"openapi":"3.0.3","info":{"title":"maison.table","version":"1.0.0","description":"Table management for hotel restaurants. The minimum inventory record an agent needs to answer \"is there a seat\", hold it, and explain itself when the answer is no. Every refusal names a typed binding_constraint. Quote and commit are separate, joined by an availability token and a TTL-bounded hold.\n\n**Tenancy** — no request ever carries a clientId field: the organization comes from the credential. (Terminology: client = tenant = organization — one entity; a *property* is a building/location within a client, so one client can run several restaurants.) User JWTs carry the `client` claim (the org picked in the portal's org switcher; null = all clients, which this app resolves only when it serves exactly one organization). Machine credentials (mk_ API keys, OAuth clients) are scoped to exactly ONE organization in the portal — one key never serves multiple clients; give each org its own credential. Within the resolved organization, `propertyId` selects the restaurant (from listProperties) and every query is additionally filtered server-side by the credential's organization — a propertyId from another org returns nothing, never leaks."},"servers":[{"url":"http://localhost:8182/api/v1","description":"Local development"}],"tags":[{"name":"Availability & Holds","description":"Quote → hold → confirm; refusals carry a typed binding_constraint"},{"name":"Reservations","description":"The book: create, modify, cancel, search, arrival status"},{"name":"Configuration","description":"Declared inventory: properties, areas, tables, products, seasons, services, exceptions, pacing"},{"name":"Ingestion","description":"CSV and email imports as reviewable proposals"},{"name":"System","description":"Liveness and contract discovery"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"JWT","description":"Portal-issued JWT (user or OAuth machine token, validated against the portal JWKS) or a portal API key (mk_…)."}},"schemas":{"BindingConstraint":{"type":"string","description":"Typed refusal reason — why the answer is no (§4.4).","enum":["closed_no_season","closed_exception","closed_online","outside_service_hours","sold_out_product","sold_out_pool","pacing_saturated","no_asset_fit","below_min_party","past_cutoff","buyout_blocked","unreachable"]},"Reservation":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"clientId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"propertyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["inquiry","quoted","held","confirmed","modified","cancelled","no_show","completed"]},"sourceChannel":{"type":"string"},"confirmationNumber":{"type":"string","description":"6-char phone-sayable code, e.g. RK8A2F"},"bookedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"cancelledAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","nullable":true},"notes":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"lines":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"guest":{"type":"object","nullable":true}}},"Error":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"type":"string"},"bindingConstraint":{"type":"string","description":"Typed refusal reason — why the answer is no (§4.4).","enum":["closed_no_season","closed_exception","closed_online","outside_service_hours","sold_out_product","sold_out_pool","pacing_saturated","no_asset_fit","below_min_party","past_cutoff","buyout_blocked","unreachable"]}}}}},"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"tags":["System"],"operationId":"healthCheck","summary":"Liveness and declared capabilities","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Service is up"}}}},"/availability":{"post":{"tags":["Availability & Holds"],"operationId":"checkAvailability","summary":"Check availability across a day — every slot, with a typed refusal when the answer is no","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["propertyId","date","partySize"],"properties":{"propertyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"date":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"partySize":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"startTime":{"type":"string","example":"18:00"},"endTime":{"type":"string","example":"21:00"},"isOnline":{"type":"boolean","description":"Evaluate the online sales channel (close_online applies)"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Per-slot availability; unavailable slots carry bindingConstraint and nearest alternatives","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"slots":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"time":{"type":"string"},"available":{"type":"boolean"},"vacancies":{"type":"integer"},"bindingConstraint":{"type":"string","description":"Typed refusal reason — why the answer is no (§4.4).","enum":["closed_no_season","closed_exception","closed_online","outside_service_hours","sold_out_product","sold_out_pool","pacing_saturated","no_asset_fit","below_min_party","past_cutoff","buyout_blocked","unreachable"]},"alternatives":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}}}}}}}}}}}}},"/availability/quote":{"post":{"tags":["Availability & Holds"],"operationId":"quoteAvailability","summary":"Quote one slot — returns an opaque availability token (TTL-bounded) to hold or book against","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["propertyId","date","time","partySize"],"properties":{"propertyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"date":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"time":{"type":"string","example":"19:30"},"partySize":{"type":"integer"},"isOnline":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Quote (available or refused with bindingConstraint)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"availabilityId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"expiresAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"available":{"type":"boolean"},"sellableProductId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"vacancies":{"type":"integer"},"bindingConstraint":{"type":"string","description":"Typed refusal reason — why the answer is no (§4.4).","enum":["closed_no_season","closed_exception","closed_online","outside_service_hours","sold_out_product","sold_out_pool","pacing_saturated","no_asset_fit","below_min_party","past_cutoff","buyout_blocked","unreachable"]},"alternatives":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}}}}}}}}}},"/holds":{"post":{"tags":["Availability & Holds"],"operationId":"holdTable","summary":"Hold inventory against a quote — decrements pools for its TTL; never oversells","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["availabilityId","propertyId","sellableProductId","quantity"],"properties":{"availabilityId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"propertyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"sellableProductId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"quantity":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Hold created","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"holdId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"utcExpiresAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}}}}},"409":{"description":"Quote expired / inventory gone / hold cap reached","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"type":"string"},"bindingConstraint":{"type":"string","description":"Typed refusal reason — why the answer is no (§4.4).","enum":["closed_no_season","closed_exception","closed_online","outside_service_hours","sold_out_product","sold_out_pool","pacing_saturated","no_asset_fit","below_min_party","past_cutoff","buyout_blocked","unreachable"]}}}}}}}}},"/holds/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["Availability & Holds"],"operationId":"releaseHold","summary":"Release a hold before it expires","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format"